00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.590
No, but.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:38.590
Speaker 1: You are right.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:44.250
Generally speaking, each successively younger
generation is more progressive than the previous

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.250
