00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.850
Now that continues to hold true.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.030
Speaker 2: Yeah.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:54.530
And but there's also like a lot of the things
that the conservative side of the spectrum

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:58.590
like hold on to are really old like traditions.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:00:59.590
Right?

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:01.190
